<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Unsigned-Binary on knowledge base</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/unsigned-binary/</link><description>Recent content in Unsigned-Binary on knowledge base</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</managingEditor><webMaster>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 11:14:03 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/unsigned-binary/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to Run Unverified Binary on MacOS</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/33cd415418ce142d633dd2ed852abdc4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 11:14:03 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/33cd415418ce142d633dd2ed852abdc4/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;If you are trying to run an unsigned binary on MacOS, you can do it by following these steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Terminal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the following command:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /path/to/your/binary
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Replace &lt;code&gt;/path/to/your/binary&lt;/code&gt; with the path to your binary file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Example: &lt;code&gt;xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/minikube-gui.app&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>